      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-n/q8-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"T = 63/ sin 15◦≈243.41 kN. The along-line equation in kN is 126 cos 30◦+ T cos 15◦−R = 40. Along L, the resultant force is 800000(0.05) = 40000 N = 40 kN. [M1] [A1] The resistance in kilonewtons is 126 cos 30◦+ 63 cot 15◦−40 ≈304.24 kN . [M1] [M1] [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
