    "id": "madas/alevel-applied-n/q11",
    "question": "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-n/q11-question-1.svg\" alt=\"A boy kicks a football from a point O on level horizontal ground. The football travels 1 freely under gravity and 2 2 seconds later it just clears the top of a tree P . The horizontal distance from  O to P is 42 m and the tree is 3 m tall. Find the speed and the direction of the football as it passes through P . ( 10 )\" style=\"--madas-width:581.3px\"></figure>",
    "steps": [
      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-n/q11-solution-1.svg\" alt=\"Starting with a diagram:\" style=\"--madas-width:536.0px\"></figure>",
