      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-applied-n/q13-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"Expand to 12 + 12λ = 10 + 20λ, so 2 = 8λ. Initially the two support tensions are in ratio 1 : 2, and after loading in ratio 1 : 4, explaining the fractions of total weight used above: Thus λ = 1 4 . [M1] [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:678.7px\"></figure>",
      "<p class=\"madas-total\">Total mark for question 13 is 10 marks.</p>"
